+
+maintainers:
+  - Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
+
+description:
+  The Samsung S5K4ECGX is a 5 megapixel (2560 x 1920) CMOS image sensor
+  with an integrated image signal processor and autofocus control that
+  outputs YCbCr 4:2:2 or JPEG over a two-lane MIPI CSI-2 interface.
+  It is controlled over I2C with 16-bit registers, most of its settings
+  being written indirectly into its internal memory. It needs a separate
+  1.2 V core supply and has a reset and a standby input.
+
